space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 不系之舟\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2023/07/26/273994722/a70754fe33a062933205c999d7c23d84_2086129380007029199.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:none;vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e「如果你也是追逐自由的人，就和所有人一齐歌唱吧。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 温暖的葡萄\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2023/07/26/273994722/f153004109d68b3ba8e387c5f8744b3f_4082739180674850703.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:none;vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e「让我来看看盖伊写了些什么…」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd4 我们的太阳\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2023/07/26/273994722/d0854a7d2d5a4b68819b420eb3e5c96e_4818754541903372207.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\